        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS\nPLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** IMMACULATE 1 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM STUDIO APARTMENT IN THE GROVE, CELBRIDGE *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom studio apartment to the rental market, ideally located in The Grove, Celbridge, Co. Kildare.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and well-designed studio apartment offers comfortable and modern living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance area, a bright open-plan living, dining and sleeping space, a modern fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and integrated appliances, and a stylish main bathroom.\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in turnkey condition, offering comfortable and contemporary living in a desirable residential location. Bright interiors, quality finishes, and an efficient layout make this an excellent rental opportunity.\nThe Grove enjoys a convenient location in Celbridge, with a wide range of local amenities nearby including shops, cafés, supermarkets, parks, and leisure facilities. Celbridge is well connected to Dublin and surrounding areas, with excellent transport links and easy access to the M4 motorway, making the location ideal for commuters.\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Immaculate 1 Bed / 1 Bath Studio Apartment</li>\n <li>Bright and well-designed open-plan living space</li>\n <li>Modern fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Integrated appliances</li>\n <li>Stylish main bathroom</li>\n <li>Presented in turnkey condition</li>\n <li>Desirable location in The Grove, Celbridge</li>\n <li>Excellent access to the M4 motorway</li>\n <li>Convenient access to Celbridge and surrounding areas</li>\n <li>Register your interest today</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
